; cat IS-A mammal. the swarupa edge is the IS-A relation.
; boot pass sees mammal-swarupa on cat → mammal-varga exists → emits [cat, varga, mammal-varga]
; anumana-viveka walks: cat → varga → mammal-varga → yukta:[heart, warm-blooded]
; → varga → animal-varga → yukta:[sensing, moving]
; → varga → living-varga → yukta:[breathing, growing]

(kosha cat
  (swarupa mammal)
  (sthita taxonomy-varga))
